  "title": "White Chocolate Blondies",
  "description": "These white chocolate blondies are studded with semi-sweet chocolate chips for chewy, buttery treats great for kids&#39; birthday parties and potlucks.",
  "authors": [
    "Jenn Rochon"
  ],
